==Battleground==
*20 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gory Groom]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Cadaver Bear]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The main threat of this stage is Cadaver Bear, who is protected by Gory Groom. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] is a good unit who can deal damage to Gory Groom.

==='''Recommended units:'''===
*[[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Flying Cat]] is a good attacker that outranges Gory Groom.
*[[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] is a ranged attacker that deals area amounts of damage, a good replacement of Manic Flying Cat.
*[[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] ([[True Form]] recommended) deals high amounts of damage combined with its massive damage against Dark enemies, can take Gory Groom down easily.
*[[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Sifu Cat]] can tank the hits of Cadaver Bear.
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] may not be specialized against black or zombies, but can take out the ecto enemies and Cerberus Kids in a single hit, it also works as a good generalist attacker.
*[[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]], dispute outranging every enemy, slows movement of Cadaver Bear and Gory Groom.

==='''Recommended Ubers:'''===
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]] is a good replacement of Ring Girl Cat, as it also deals massive damage against Dark enemies.
*Any [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|IRON LEGION]] Uber can outrange Cadaver Bear and deal high amounts of damage against it, even though [[Mighty Kat-A-Pult (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Kat-A-Pult]] doesn't deal massive damage, it can weaken Cadaver Bear and make your units attack it.

